Package: watermark
Title: Traceable Watermarks for 'ggplot2' Graphics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Joe", "Despres", , "joe.r.despres@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Stamp 'ggplot2' plots with watermarks you can trace back to the
    analysis that made them. An invisible dot code along the bottom margin
    carries a short ID that survives screenshots, JPEG compression and
    rescaling, and is protected by a checksum so a decode is either exact or
    rejected. Visible text stamps ("DRAFT", "CONFIDENTIAL") and provenance
    metadata embedded in PNG files complete the toolkit. Watermarks are
    ordinary plot components added with '+', and never alter scales,
    coordinates or facets.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/despresj/watermark
BugReports: https://github.com/despresj/watermark/issues
